msgctxt "92"
msgid "Taichi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Whaddya want, Uncle Kaz? Can't you see we're busy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's your turn to go shopping today! You can't just keep horsing around all "
"the time while everyone else takes care of you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I know, just give me five more minutes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "But this is a big match, Uncle Kaz! I'll go in five minutes, swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "...Fine. But you're going the second you're done!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"You'll be in big trouble if I hear you didn't go, do you understand? Same "
"for you, Mitsuo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Hey, why am I getting dragged into this!? Taichi, let's just go! We can "
"wrestle some more after we go shopping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "You're not gonna get away that easy! Take this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"(I know Taichi loves wrestling, but he really needs to start being more "
"responsible...)"
msgstr ""

